cat > resources/growth_budget_slide.md <<'DEVILS_ANALYST_EOF'
# Copperleaf Teas: where should the 2027 growth budget go?

Prepared by Brand team for the leadership meeting. Source: retail audit H1 2026 vs H1 2025.

| Region | Unit share H1 2025 | Unit share H1 2026 | Copperleaf sell-out growth |
|---|---|---|---|
| Coastal | 25.9% | 29.1% | +19% |
| Midvale | 19.3% | 24.5% | -8% |
| Riverside | 19.4% | 21.5% | +13% |

- **Coastal is our strongest and fastest-growing region.** Highest share and the fastest sell-out growth.
- **Midvale is turning:** share up 5.2 pts.
- **Shoppers back it:** our AI shopper panel (500 personas) rates Copperleaf 4.6/5 on brand preference in Coastal.
- Total unit share across our three regions: 25.4%; value share 30.1%.

## Recommendation
Put 60% of the GBP 1.5M 2027 growth budget into Coastal (more shelf space, in-store media), 25% into Midvale, 15% into Riverside.
